# Stray Convex codegen. Running `convex dev`/`codegen` from this directory generates an EMPTY
# function set (there are no Convex functions here — they live in the repo-root convex/), and pushing
# that would wipe the functions on whichever deployment is targeted. Mobile code imports the root
# codegen via an explicit ../../../convex/_generated path.
convex/
